WEBVTT

00:31.662 --> 00:35.212
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.232 --> 00:38.612
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.882 --> 00:44.852
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:46.012 --> 00:49.642
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.662 --> 00:53.172
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.192 --> 00:56.682
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.702 --> 01:00.212
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.232 --> 01:06.292
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.552 --> 01:23.832
Si Jin

01:23.852 --> 01:28.352
Episode 16

01:36.332 --> 01:38.652
Put me down.

01:39.572 --> 01:40.962
It's going to rain.

01:41.692 --> 01:43.452
Take shelter in the woods ahead.

01:43.602 --> 01:44.962
Here.

01:48.242 --> 01:49.602
Careful.

02:31.082 --> 02:32.442
In...

02:32.492 --> 02:34.162
my childhood,

02:34.212 --> 02:36.492
my sister was scared of thunder.

02:36.842 --> 02:38.562
I did that a lot.

02:43.052 --> 02:45.222
Which foot hurts?

02:45.242 --> 02:46.322
Let me see.

02:46.342 --> 02:47.202
It's fine.

02:47.212 --> 02:48.812
- Let me check.
- No need.

02:48.842 --> 02:49.782
What's wrong?

02:49.802 --> 02:51.382
I got dirt on it.

02:51.402 --> 02:52.912
When you rescued me,

02:52.932 --> 02:54.652
my body was covered with dirt.

02:55.522 --> 02:56.882
Show me.

03:00.172 --> 03:01.662
It was sunny a minute ago,

03:01.682 --> 03:03.752
and here comes the rain.

03:03.772 --> 03:04.652
I wonder

03:04.652 --> 03:05.912
when it'll stop.

03:05.932 --> 03:07.962
Will it slow us down?

03:15.932 --> 03:18.342
Zhan made a fire.

03:18.362 --> 03:19.722
Will the rain

03:20.452 --> 03:21.932
put it out?

03:27.522 --> 03:29.332
Wait until the rain stops.

03:34.842 --> 03:37.592
I... I need to massage it hard,

03:37.612 --> 03:38.972
so bear with it.

03:41.452 --> 03:42.812
Where

03:43.212 --> 03:45.062
did you learn this?

03:45.082 --> 03:46.752
When I was a boy,

03:46.772 --> 03:48.962
I jumped over the wall to get out

03:49.332 --> 03:51.312
and sprained my ankle a lot.

03:51.332 --> 03:53.122
That's how I learned.

03:53.682 --> 03:56.152
After digging a hole in the wall,

03:56.172 --> 03:57.882
I had no more sprains.

04:01.682 --> 04:03.042
Does it still hurt?

04:06.922 --> 04:08.282
Not anymore!

04:20.692 --> 04:22.882
How strange.

04:23.132 --> 04:25.762
Such a downpour on a sunny day.

04:29.322 --> 04:31.052
♪ From place to place ♪

04:31.052 --> 04:35.992
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

04:36.362 --> 04:38.742
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

04:38.742 --> 04:42.972
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

04:43.682 --> 04:46.082
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

04:46.102 --> 04:49.762
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

04:49.782 --> 04:53.202
♪ Growing between us ♪

04:53.352 --> 04:58.872
♪ And breeding love ♪

05:07.772 --> 05:09.372
What a huge tree!

05:09.812 --> 05:11.492
You know what?

05:11.602 --> 05:12.602
This tree is

05:12.602 --> 05:15.142
over 100 years old.

05:15.162 --> 05:16.432
It's said

05:16.452 --> 05:18.792
that an immortal

05:18.812 --> 05:20.672
would rest on the treetop

05:20.692 --> 05:23.702
whenever he passed by.

05:23.722 --> 05:26.502
It's evergreen

05:26.522 --> 05:28.582
with new sprouts every year,

05:28.602 --> 05:30.812
which is auspicious.

05:30.922 --> 05:32.112
That's why

05:32.132 --> 05:34.562
people from all over this area

05:34.602 --> 05:37.062
come to make wishes

05:37.082 --> 05:39.612
under this tree.

05:39.722 --> 05:41.632
As wind bells ring,

05:41.652 --> 05:44.552
prayers are said.

05:44.572 --> 05:46.282
When immortals hear them,

05:46.282 --> 05:48.762
they'll come to help you.

05:49.452 --> 05:50.812
Will all the wishes

05:50.812 --> 05:52.022
come true?

05:52.042 --> 05:54.082
Yes, if you're pious.

05:54.082 --> 05:55.022
I'm most pious!

05:55.042 --> 05:56.402
Give me a tablet.

05:57.082 --> 05:59.082
- I'll take one.
- Look.

06:08.132 --> 06:09.452
Hey, don't stare at me.

06:09.452 --> 06:11.522
I'm going to write my wish.

06:12.282 --> 06:13.682
I'll write mine, too.

06:16.212 --> 06:17.632
I also want to make a wish.

06:17.652 --> 06:18.772
You can't read

06:18.772 --> 06:19.822
or write.

06:19.842 --> 06:21.242
I'll write it for her.

06:21.332 --> 06:22.972
What's your wish?

06:23.252 --> 06:25.172
I wish the First Branch well.

06:25.692 --> 06:27.522
What about yourself?

06:27.652 --> 06:29.952
(First Branch well.)
You're happy, I'm happy.

06:30.332 --> 06:31.692
Look.

06:32.572 --> 06:34.072
I... I'll tie it for her.

06:34.482 --> 06:36.022
No, Long Dan. I'll do it!

06:36.042 --> 06:37.312
Give it back!

06:37.332 --> 06:39.002
I'll do it for you.

06:40.192 --> 06:44.192
(Make my family proud. Serve our country.)

06:46.152 --> 06:50.832
(Travel around and help others.)

06:51.542 --> 06:54.662
♪ Feelings remain but things are complicated ♪

06:54.662 --> 06:56.392
(May Jiang Si...)

06:58.672 --> 07:01.742
♪ I can't make up my mind ♪

07:02.332 --> 07:04.992
♪ Can I still make it through the long night ♪

07:05.012 --> 07:06.372
Are you done?

07:06.922 --> 07:08.282
I'll tie it.

07:09.402 --> 07:10.672
No peeking.

07:10.692 --> 07:12.052
Sure, sure.

07:12.852 --> 07:16.622
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

07:18.712 --> 07:20.082
(Travel around and help others.)

07:20.082 --> 07:22.512
(Make my family proud. Serve our country.)

07:24.432 --> 07:27.582
(Wish for peace. Wish the First Branch well.)

07:27.602 --> 07:30.912
♪ How can I move on ♪

07:30.912 --> 07:34.782
♪ I can't forget about you ♪

07:34.802 --> 07:38.192
♪ However long the road is ♪

07:38.212 --> 07:42.472
♪ If love is strong, one will have no fear ♪

07:43.152 --> 07:50.672
(May things and people be as they are.)

07:52.692 --> 07:56.202
♪ Can I still make it through the long night ♪

07:56.222 --> 07:59.842
♪ I fear that we'll part again ♪

07:59.862 --> 08:03.732
♪ A piercing ache lingers within ♪

08:05.132 --> 08:08.412
May Jiang Si find her love.

08:08.482 --> 08:11.372
May things and people be as they are.

08:11.692 --> 08:14.272
Chief, you didn't tie Miss Si's...

08:14.292 --> 08:17.962
♪ The past fades as old dreams return ♪

08:17.962 --> 08:21.412
♪ How can I move on ♪

08:21.432 --> 08:25.142
(...find her love.)

08:25.162 --> 08:28.762
♪ However long the road is ♪

08:28.792 --> 08:32.352
♪ No matter the cost,
I'll try to restore ♪

08:32.352 --> 08:38.422
♪ The sealed memories ♪

08:38.442 --> 08:39.522
You said Sang Qi'd be sent

08:39.522 --> 08:41.262
to the suburban execution ground, right?

08:41.282 --> 08:42.472
It's been six hours.

08:42.492 --> 08:44.152
Is your information accurate?

08:44.652 --> 08:45.522
It's been confirmed

08:45.522 --> 08:46.612
by more than one informant.

08:46.612 --> 08:47.972
It's accurate.

08:48.522 --> 08:50.112
That tricky Commandant Yu

08:50.132 --> 08:51.972
has finally left Ling'an.

08:52.092 --> 08:54.252
This is the best chance to rescue Sang Qi.

09:02.442 --> 09:03.802
There they are.

09:12.892 --> 09:13.732
The one leading them

09:13.732 --> 09:14.732
is Vice Prefect Zhen.

09:14.732 --> 09:16.092
It can't be wrong.

09:18.282 --> 09:19.642
Sang Qi!

09:24.092 --> 09:25.452
Do it!

09:38.702 --> 09:40.062
Watch out!

09:42.172 --> 09:43.162
Don't kill them!

09:43.162 --> 09:44.522
Retreat!

09:52.652 --> 09:54.012
Stop him!

09:58.132 --> 09:59.692
A step too late.

10:00.562 --> 10:02.022
Head back to the office.

10:08.092 --> 10:09.752
It's raining heavily.

10:09.772 --> 10:10.772
Let's find a place

10:10.772 --> 10:11.902
to take shelter.

10:11.922 --> 10:13.182
Got it!

10:13.202 --> 10:14.852
Be careful.

10:19.872 --> 10:26.592
(Shan'an Clinic)

10:48.512 --> 10:50.952
(Shan'an Clinic, Shen Xin'er.)

10:50.972 --> 10:51.922
I'm really sorry

10:51.922 --> 10:53.692
that I scared you.

10:53.772 --> 10:55.522
(Owner, Mrs. Shen)
I own the Shan'an Clinic.

10:55.522 --> 10:56.502
I'm Shen.

10:56.522 --> 10:57.562
Mrs. Shen,

10:57.562 --> 10:59.182
we came from Ling'an,

10:59.202 --> 11:00.612
and we were caught in the storm.

11:00.612 --> 11:02.632
Do you mind if we stay the night here?

11:02.652 --> 11:03.492
Not at all.

11:03.492 --> 11:05.382
Sorry for troubling you.

11:05.402 --> 11:06.242
Mrs. Shen,

11:06.252 --> 11:07.722
- why did you wear that mask?
- Wait.

11:07.722 --> 11:09.182
It freaked me out.

11:09.202 --> 11:11.072
The thing is

11:11.092 --> 11:13.772
my clinic is in a remote area.

11:13.772 --> 11:15.132
The people I deal with

11:15.132 --> 11:16.912
include bandits.

11:16.912 --> 11:18.622
(Bring Back the Dead)
I have to be careful!

11:18.622 --> 11:19.542
Jiang.

11:19.562 --> 11:20.902
I'll go look around.

11:20.922 --> 11:22.182
Sure, sure.

11:22.202 --> 11:23.952
Normally,

11:23.972 --> 11:26.632
I wouldn't let strangers stay the night here,

11:26.652 --> 11:27.652
but

11:27.652 --> 11:29.992
such a downpour is rare.

11:30.012 --> 11:32.992
If you're seeking shelter,

11:33.012 --> 11:34.772
I should let you stay, right?

11:34.772 --> 11:36.922
We're decent people, ma'am.

11:36.922 --> 11:37.772
Once the rain stops,

11:37.772 --> 11:38.922
we'll leave immediately.

11:38.922 --> 11:40.802
We won't cause you more trouble.

11:42.522 --> 11:45.592
This is my daughter, Shen Xin'er.

11:45.612 --> 11:46.892
There's only the two of us

11:46.892 --> 11:48.182
in our family.

11:48.202 --> 11:50.202
Thanks to this clinic

11:50.202 --> 11:51.662
and my medical skills,

11:51.682 --> 11:53.692
we can barely make a living.

11:54.322 --> 11:55.382
Xin'er,

11:55.402 --> 11:57.922
cook some noodles for them.

11:57.922 --> 12:00.232
- Hot food will warm them.
- No need.

12:00.252 --> 12:01.092
That's too kind.

12:01.092 --> 12:03.452
- Thanks, Miss.
- It's fine. Let her go.

12:03.852 --> 12:05.212
Aman.

12:05.522 --> 12:08.492
Here's some money, ma'am.

12:08.612 --> 12:10.042
This isn't an inn

12:10.042 --> 12:11.162
but a shabby hut.

12:11.162 --> 12:12.282
I can't charge you for...

12:12.282 --> 12:13.522
If you don't take it,

12:13.522 --> 12:15.142
we can't stay the night here.

12:15.162 --> 12:16.502
I insist you take it.

12:16.522 --> 12:18.022
Thank you, Miss.

12:18.042 --> 12:19.692
I'll take it then.

12:20.402 --> 12:21.902
Sit and rest.

12:21.922 --> 12:23.302
I'll go check the noodles.

12:23.302 --> 12:24.152
- Thank you.
- Sure.

12:24.162 --> 12:25.012
Thanks a lot, ma'am.

12:25.012 --> 12:26.372
You're welcome.

12:28.922 --> 12:31.122
"Virtue and Skills".

12:34.152 --> 12:36.752
(Kind and Skilled)

12:36.772 --> 12:38.132
Here they come!

12:38.562 --> 12:40.162
Eat them while they're hot, Miss.

12:40.162 --> 12:41.442
- Thanks.
- Here you go.

12:41.442 --> 12:42.972
One bowl each.

12:43.492 --> 12:44.922
Thanks, Miss Shen.

12:45.442 --> 12:46.662
- Thanks.
- Thank you.

12:46.682 --> 12:48.042
Sure.

13:01.682 --> 13:03.402
I was too hasty

13:03.612 --> 13:05.022
and fell into their trap.

13:05.042 --> 13:07.092
They used a body double for Sang Qi.

13:07.492 --> 13:09.142
Did he already die?

13:09.162 --> 13:10.972
I'll find out.

13:11.092 --> 13:13.002
If he's still alive in jail,

13:13.442 --> 13:15.602
we'll go to Capital Security to rescue me.

14:39.612 --> 14:41.872
What's taking the girls so long?

14:41.892 --> 14:43.492
It's time to go.

14:44.252 --> 14:45.472
Bad news!

14:45.492 --> 14:47.662
Commandant Yu, Young Master Zhan,

14:47.682 --> 14:48.782
help!

14:48.802 --> 14:49.652
What's wrong?

14:49.652 --> 14:51.522
Miss Si is burning up.

14:51.612 --> 14:53.012
Why is she suddenly having a fever?

14:53.012 --> 14:54.352
I don't know.

14:54.372 --> 14:55.252
Miss Si

14:55.252 --> 14:57.142
was born weak, I guess.

14:57.162 --> 14:58.972
She caught a cold in the rain,

14:58.972 --> 15:00.202
causing the fever.

15:00.202 --> 15:01.042
What to do?

15:01.042 --> 15:02.302
Don't worry.

15:02.322 --> 15:04.072
Shan'an Clinic is well-known

15:04.092 --> 15:05.682
in our village

15:05.682 --> 15:07.092
and in this entire area

15:07.092 --> 15:08.502
for my medical skills.

15:08.522 --> 15:09.882
I'll go check.

15:10.732 --> 15:12.112
She's a girl.

15:12.132 --> 15:14.022
You boys can't go to her room.

15:14.042 --> 15:15.112
Let's go, Xin'er.

15:15.132 --> 15:16.852
Thank you, ma'am.

15:18.162 --> 15:19.322
Hurry, Mrs. Shen!

15:19.322 --> 15:20.802
She feels even warmer.

15:29.852 --> 15:30.902
She was fine.

15:30.922 --> 15:32.642
Why is she having a high fever?

15:34.162 --> 15:37.422
She's not too strong a girl.

15:37.442 --> 15:39.732
The rain gave her a cold.

15:40.012 --> 15:42.492
That's why she's burning up.

15:44.772 --> 15:47.182
Mrs. Shen, actually,

15:47.202 --> 15:49.202
I think I saw something evil

15:49.202 --> 15:50.752
last night.

15:50.772 --> 15:52.112
Was this old house

15:52.132 --> 15:53.852
haunted by evil spirits?

15:54.442 --> 15:57.382
Could she be...?

15:57.402 --> 15:58.522
You're right.

15:58.522 --> 16:00.452
It's possible.

16:00.652 --> 16:02.262
This cottage was built

16:02.282 --> 16:03.902
ages ago.

16:03.922 --> 16:07.232
We have nowhere else to go

16:07.252 --> 16:09.252
and have to make do with it.

16:09.442 --> 16:12.632
I'll do acupuncture on her

16:12.652 --> 16:14.022
and decoct herbs for her.

16:14.042 --> 16:15.502
I think she'll be fine.

16:15.522 --> 16:17.572
Thank you very much.

16:32.252 --> 16:33.812
What's taking them so long?

16:34.682 --> 16:36.572
- Let's go check.
- Sure.

16:38.682 --> 16:39.802
I just finished

16:39.802 --> 16:41.492
the acupuncture on her.

16:41.492 --> 16:42.902
You can't go inside, boys.

16:42.922 --> 16:43.852
She's having a bad cold.

16:43.852 --> 16:45.952
It's under control for now.

16:45.972 --> 16:47.682
But Miss Si is too weak.

16:47.682 --> 16:49.472
I've run out of herbs.

16:49.492 --> 16:51.042
Right now,

16:51.042 --> 16:52.302
we need ice to bring down

16:52.312 --> 16:53.162
her fever quickly.

16:53.162 --> 16:54.292
I'll get it. Where is it?

16:54.292 --> 16:56.372
The ice cellar is 30 li west

16:56.372 --> 16:57.402
- of the village.
- Sure.

16:57.402 --> 16:58.462
Hurry!

16:58.482 --> 16:59.382
Miss, Miss,

16:59.402 --> 17:00.962
do you remember the herbs

17:00.962 --> 17:02.402
I just prescribed?
- Yes.

17:02.402 --> 17:04.132
They have to be picked up separately

17:04.132 --> 17:05.402
from the pharmacies I said.

17:05.402 --> 17:06.292
Sure, sure, I'll go.

17:06.292 --> 17:07.702
- Aman, Chuchu.
- Yes.

17:07.722 --> 17:09.242
- Be quick!
- Got it. Come on.

17:09.242 --> 17:10.922
Don't worry. I'll stay and watch.

17:10.922 --> 17:12.842
Take your time. Calm down.

17:13.482 --> 17:14.382
Xin'er,

17:14.402 --> 17:16.222
go get some water for Miss Si.

17:16.242 --> 17:17.082
Sure.

17:17.092 --> 17:18.832
I'll fetch some dandelions.

17:18.852 --> 17:20.242
- I'll get them.
- Sure. Go ahead.

17:20.242 --> 17:21.132
- Stay here.
- I will.

17:21.132 --> 17:22.222
Thanks, ma'am.

17:22.242 --> 17:23.602
No worries.

17:46.442 --> 17:47.282
Young man.

17:47.292 --> 17:49.652
- Thanks.
- Drink up. Don't get heatstroke.

17:49.652 --> 17:50.572
Thank you very much.

17:50.572 --> 17:52.592
Go back and rest. I'm here.

17:52.612 --> 17:54.652
Sweat's dripping from your face. Drink.

17:59.612 --> 18:01.762
Why isn't Chief back yet?

18:20.722 --> 18:22.212
Miss Shen,

18:22.572 --> 18:25.072
please look after Miss Si for a while.

18:25.092 --> 18:26.092
By the way,

18:26.092 --> 18:27.602
where's the toilet?

18:27.922 --> 18:29.332
- Over there.
- Thanks.

18:29.332 --> 18:30.692
Thank you. Thanks.

18:38.812 --> 18:41.042
Miss Si, your decoction.

18:45.572 --> 18:46.932
Miss Si?

19:14.682 --> 19:16.082
What are you doing?

19:18.332 --> 19:20.182
Miss Si, you're sick.

19:20.202 --> 19:22.172
- Take this.
- I won't!

19:22.372 --> 19:23.812
Aman, Aman!

19:23.812 --> 19:24.652
Chuchu!

19:24.652 --> 19:26.012
You don't trust me?

19:26.892 --> 19:28.412
I don't.

19:28.852 --> 19:30.792
No wonder I felt someone

19:30.812 --> 19:32.972
touching my hands when I was dizzy.

19:33.482 --> 19:34.932
You're a girl.

19:35.052 --> 19:37.172
What's your problem?

19:41.202 --> 19:42.892
A girl?

19:45.332 --> 19:47.652
You think you're so smart, huh?

19:50.092 --> 19:51.132
You're a man!

19:51.132 --> 19:52.442
You had me at hello.

19:52.442 --> 19:54.242
Zhan! Help!

19:54.242 --> 19:55.352
Let me go!

19:55.372 --> 19:57.892
Help! Zhan!

19:58.242 --> 19:59.762
Save it. No one can hear you.

19:59.762 --> 20:01.372
Help! Zhan!

20:01.372 --> 20:02.732
Xin'er, stop.

20:08.052 --> 20:09.682
Are you insane?

20:09.682 --> 20:11.402
She's a treasure.

20:11.402 --> 20:12.332
We need her.

20:12.332 --> 20:13.812
Don't ravish her.

20:13.812 --> 20:15.312
I like her.

20:15.332 --> 20:18.042
Don't touch her. Control yourself.

20:18.162 --> 20:19.852
It's not showtime yet.

20:19.852 --> 20:21.412
Don't act on impulse.

20:22.092 --> 20:23.452
Fine.

20:35.922 --> 20:37.972
Who are you? Stop.

20:39.852 --> 20:41.212
Watch him.

20:42.242 --> 20:44.562
Miss Si! Miss Si!

20:46.812 --> 20:48.172
Go ahead.

21:02.292 --> 21:04.202
It was all my fault, Chief!

21:04.202 --> 21:05.652
I failed to protect Miss Si.

21:05.652 --> 21:07.482
A gang of bandits took her away.

21:07.482 --> 21:08.442
Miss Si!

21:08.442 --> 21:10.142
- After we came here,
- Miss Si!

21:10.162 --> 21:13.592
she had a fever. Then bandits came.

21:13.612 --> 21:14.892
Was that a coincidence?

21:14.892 --> 21:16.112
Sir,

21:16.132 --> 21:17.902
you can't blame me for it.

21:17.922 --> 21:19.852
When I kindly took you in,

21:19.852 --> 21:21.482
I told you about the bandits

21:21.482 --> 21:22.682
harming the people here.

21:22.682 --> 21:23.812
My poor daughter

21:23.812 --> 21:24.932
almost got abducted, too.

21:24.952 --> 21:25.892
- Yu,
- Those animals!

21:25.892 --> 21:27.632
the top priority is to find Si.

21:27.652 --> 21:28.662
Tell the authorities.

21:28.682 --> 21:30.272
They'll find her faster than us.

21:30.292 --> 21:31.682
Aman and I will recheck the area.

21:31.682 --> 21:32.762
Maybe we'll find something.

21:32.762 --> 21:33.722
Let's start looking.

21:33.722 --> 21:35.322
Maybe we'll find her.

21:36.402 --> 21:37.762
Tell the authorities!

21:42.482 --> 21:44.972
Who's beating the drum this late?

21:47.722 --> 21:50.842
It's you two civilians, huh?

21:51.402 --> 21:53.632
You disturbed my sleep.

21:53.652 --> 21:55.372
(Magistrate Jia)
You know the consequences?

21:55.372 --> 21:57.242
Sir, bandits broke into the Shan'an Clinic

21:57.242 --> 21:58.162
and abducted my sister.

21:58.162 --> 22:00.262
Please send officers to look for her now!

22:02.162 --> 22:03.562
Bandits?

22:04.482 --> 22:05.632
I see.

22:05.652 --> 22:07.222
Leave your report here.

22:07.242 --> 22:09.792
If she doesn't come back in two days,

22:09.812 --> 22:11.072
I'll

22:11.092 --> 22:13.322
have my men search for her.

22:13.342 --> 22:14.192
What...?

22:14.202 --> 22:16.172
You're in charge of this area.

22:16.202 --> 22:17.612
If your delay puts her in danger,

22:17.612 --> 22:18.922
can you take the consequences?

22:18.922 --> 22:20.162
Here in the yamen,

22:20.162 --> 22:22.422
I act by law.

22:22.442 --> 22:24.132
Don't tell me what to do.

22:24.132 --> 22:26.382
If anything happens to her
in your jurisdiction,

22:26.402 --> 22:27.532
I assure you

22:27.532 --> 22:29.402
that you'll lose your post forever.

22:29.402 --> 22:30.792
How dare you!

22:30.812 --> 22:32.272
Who are you

22:32.292 --> 22:33.872
to threaten me?

22:33.892 --> 22:35.612
Stop! Stop right there!

22:35.612 --> 22:37.872
(Yamen)

22:40.612 --> 22:41.972
Guard.

22:44.202 --> 22:45.982
Send a message to those two

22:46.002 --> 22:47.742
to unload the goods soon.

22:47.762 --> 22:48.902
A storm's coming.

22:48.922 --> 22:50.282
Yes, Master.

22:53.232 --> 22:56.752
(Jiang Si had a fever, 100 taels a night.)

22:59.572 --> 23:01.902
If this batch is sold,

23:01.922 --> 23:04.312
we'll make a killing.

23:04.332 --> 23:06.292
Jiang Si is the best.

23:06.292 --> 23:07.482
Some big shot likes her.

23:07.482 --> 23:09.212
He's willing to pay more.

23:12.292 --> 23:13.652
Mother,

23:13.962 --> 23:16.632
I also like her a lot.

23:16.652 --> 23:17.902
How about

23:17.922 --> 23:19.692
we keep her?

23:19.712 --> 23:21.072
Anyway,

23:21.092 --> 23:23.072
we've made enough money.

23:23.092 --> 23:24.982
You fool!

23:25.002 --> 23:26.362
Listen,

23:26.442 --> 23:27.962
she's a rare beauty

23:27.962 --> 23:29.762
and worth a ton.

23:29.812 --> 23:30.942
Without her,

23:30.962 --> 23:32.002
do you know how much money

23:32.002 --> 23:33.182
we'll lose?

23:33.202 --> 23:35.372
Don't you even think about it!

23:35.372 --> 23:36.842
Go away.

23:37.132 --> 23:38.492
Go!

23:50.052 --> 23:51.842
Go watch her.

24:08.652 --> 24:10.012
Yu,

24:10.132 --> 24:11.552
what to do now?

24:11.572 --> 24:13.652
Young Master Zhan, Mr. Yu!

24:15.532 --> 24:17.322
Master Qin!

24:17.612 --> 24:19.072
What happened to you?

24:19.092 --> 24:20.552
I came to report a case.

24:20.812 --> 24:22.182
My wife, Rong, is missing.

24:22.202 --> 24:23.972
Her too?

24:24.402 --> 24:26.032
When I was at the Jiang's,

24:26.052 --> 24:27.552
I received her letter,

24:27.572 --> 24:28.982
saying that she felt unwell

24:29.002 --> 24:31.462
and meant to go to the Shan'an Clinic.

24:31.482 --> 24:32.762
- Then
- That clinic again.

24:32.762 --> 24:34.382
I didn't hear from her again.

24:34.402 --> 24:35.942
I was worried about her condition

24:35.962 --> 24:37.522
and rushed back home.

24:37.812 --> 24:39.172
Rong.

24:49.092 --> 24:50.452
Rong!

24:52.372 --> 24:53.732
Rong!

24:55.002 --> 24:56.362
Rong!

24:57.852 --> 25:00.922
- Rong!
- You're back, Master Qin.

25:00.922 --> 25:02.032
Ms. Li,

25:02.052 --> 25:03.382
did you see my wife?

25:03.402 --> 25:05.082
What happened to our family?

25:05.922 --> 25:07.032
Uh...

25:07.052 --> 25:08.452
Say it!

25:09.202 --> 25:10.072
I went to the yamen,

25:10.092 --> 25:11.312
but that magistrate

25:11.332 --> 25:13.412
didn't care about his people at all.

25:13.832 --> 25:15.272
(Bring Back the Dead)

25:18.392 --> 25:19.752
(Shan'an Clinic)

25:19.762 --> 25:20.832
Oh no!

25:20.852 --> 25:22.752
That woman and her daughter did it.

25:28.442 --> 25:30.632
A new girl, ma'am?

25:30.652 --> 25:32.012
Let me see.

25:33.892 --> 25:36.112
How young and lovely!

25:36.132 --> 25:37.652
Get your dirty paws off her.

25:37.652 --> 25:39.692
She's gold.

25:39.762 --> 25:40.742
Yes, fine.

25:40.762 --> 25:41.742
Take her inside.

25:41.762 --> 25:42.892
Go ahead. Move.

25:42.892 --> 25:44.522
Watch her closely!

25:50.482 --> 25:52.422
- Chief.
- Anything?

25:52.442 --> 25:53.662
No. I found nothing here.

25:53.682 --> 25:55.362
There's nothing in this room.

25:56.722 --> 25:58.322
I found knockout powder.

26:00.402 --> 26:01.742
Look.

26:01.762 --> 26:02.612
The ghostly figure

26:02.612 --> 26:04.072
I saw last night is real.

26:04.092 --> 26:05.792
I guess the Shens meant to drug me

26:05.812 --> 26:07.532
but gave up after knowing I could fight.

26:07.532 --> 26:08.872
Commandant Yu,

26:08.892 --> 26:10.242
look, perfume powder from our shop!

26:10.242 --> 26:11.442
Miss Si must've left it.

26:11.442 --> 26:12.312
Where did you find it?

26:12.312 --> 26:13.442
It spreads from the gate.

26:13.442 --> 26:14.372
Let's go.

26:14.392 --> 26:16.872
(Shan'an Clinic)

26:27.832 --> 26:30.182
(Rong)

26:30.202 --> 26:31.692
Where am I?

26:32.052 --> 26:34.352
A hut in the mountain.

26:34.372 --> 26:35.532
There are a lot more

26:35.532 --> 26:37.602
of such huts nearby

26:37.762 --> 26:38.922
filled with the women

26:38.922 --> 26:40.132
abducted by that old hen

26:40.132 --> 26:41.692
and her son.

26:42.372 --> 26:43.802
You too?

26:45.532 --> 26:47.362
I'm different.

26:47.812 --> 26:49.662
I'm married.

26:49.682 --> 26:51.522
No one wants to buy me.

26:52.052 --> 26:53.842
May I know your name?

26:54.892 --> 26:56.252
Rong.

26:58.242 --> 26:59.482
It's been a long time

26:59.482 --> 27:01.282
since anyone asked me my name.

27:04.812 --> 27:06.172
Rong,

27:06.922 --> 27:09.322
have you never tried to escape?

27:11.402 --> 27:14.692
I would if I could.

27:14.762 --> 27:17.172
Those outside all work for those two.

27:18.002 --> 27:19.332
They pretend

27:19.332 --> 27:21.762
to be physicians

27:22.002 --> 27:23.332
and use their clinic as a front

27:23.332 --> 27:24.902
for human trafficking.

27:24.922 --> 27:27.132
They've raked in enough money

27:27.402 --> 27:29.932
and hired many people to watch us.

27:34.652 --> 27:36.362
There's no chance.

27:36.922 --> 27:39.172
I've tried over and over

27:40.242 --> 27:42.212
but got caught

27:42.922 --> 27:44.842
and beaten up every time.

27:45.162 --> 27:46.092
Even if I made it out,

27:46.092 --> 27:47.972
how could I live on?

27:48.052 --> 27:49.412
I've...

27:51.722 --> 27:54.652
That effeminate animal has...

27:56.242 --> 27:57.462
I...

27:57.482 --> 27:58.352
Rong,

27:58.372 --> 27:59.402
we'll find a way

27:59.402 --> 28:00.552
to escape.

28:00.572 --> 28:02.052
Think about your family.

28:02.052 --> 28:03.892
We can't give up.

28:06.962 --> 28:08.322
My husband...

28:08.892 --> 28:10.292
My husband hasn't

28:10.292 --> 28:12.562
heard from me for a long time.

28:13.092 --> 28:15.932
He must still be waiting for me.

28:17.372 --> 28:18.732
Be quiet!

28:30.572 --> 28:32.362
Cheers, guys! Drink up!

28:36.572 --> 28:37.722
What's taking Laosi so long

28:37.722 --> 28:38.682
to bring them food?

28:38.682 --> 28:39.662
Go and check.

28:39.682 --> 28:40.742
You guys drink.

28:40.762 --> 28:42.122
Hurry!

28:42.922 --> 28:45.042
Eat, Brother.

28:46.922 --> 28:48.682
Are the new arrivals today

28:48.682 --> 28:49.902
good enough?

28:49.922 --> 28:51.652
- Is there anyone you like?
- She's hot.

28:51.652 --> 28:52.732
- You like her?
- All good.

28:52.732 --> 28:54.012
Let's go.

28:54.892 --> 28:56.602
I like what you said.

28:57.812 --> 28:58.682
Come on. Cheers.

28:58.682 --> 28:59.612
Drink up.

28:59.612 --> 29:00.922
- Here.
- Drink up.

29:00.922 --> 29:02.202
Come on. Keep going.

29:02.202 --> 29:04.602
- Fill the cups.
- Keep drinking.

29:06.682 --> 29:08.972
That chick is a lady.

29:12.532 --> 29:13.962
- Run!
- Who's there?

29:13.962 --> 29:15.892
Stop!

29:18.202 --> 29:19.922
Run! Go get help to rescue me!

29:19.922 --> 29:21.282
Rong!

29:22.242 --> 29:23.602
Rong!

29:30.402 --> 29:31.402
You two go that way.

29:31.402 --> 29:32.922
- Yes. Let's go.
- You, follow me.

29:32.922 --> 29:34.282
Yes.

29:36.292 --> 29:37.932
- Hurry!
- Go!

29:38.892 --> 29:39.732
Catch her!

29:39.742 --> 29:41.112
Stop!

29:41.332 --> 29:42.512
Stop!

29:42.532 --> 29:43.892
Stop!

29:44.202 --> 29:45.562
Stop there!

29:50.002 --> 29:51.362
Over there!

29:51.962 --> 29:52.922
You two go that way.

29:52.922 --> 29:53.762
Let's go.

29:53.782 --> 29:55.702
- Let's go this way.
- Yes.

29:55.722 --> 29:57.082
Where's she?

30:07.002 --> 30:08.362
Come on.

30:12.812 --> 30:14.512
Doing a runner, huh?

30:14.532 --> 30:16.002
Are you done?

30:23.052 --> 30:24.452
We got her back.

30:25.242 --> 30:27.132
I'm exhausted.

30:28.962 --> 30:30.182
Where's Rong?

30:30.202 --> 30:31.652
Who?

30:31.922 --> 30:34.312
You mean that woman carrying my baby?

30:34.332 --> 30:35.422
Mother,

30:35.442 --> 30:37.112
it's the one trying to run away with her.

30:37.132 --> 30:38.902
What did you do to her?

30:38.922 --> 30:40.872
When I brought her back,

30:40.892 --> 30:42.492
I took her pulse.

30:42.652 --> 30:45.082
To my surprise, she's one month pregnant.

30:45.612 --> 30:47.352
We can only sell her to a brothel

30:47.372 --> 30:48.982
at a loss before she shows.

30:49.002 --> 30:50.732
- Bring her over.
- Move!

30:50.762 --> 30:53.002
- Rong!
- Come on. She's here.

30:53.092 --> 30:54.452
Rong!

30:55.202 --> 30:56.762
Miss Si...

30:57.852 --> 30:59.072
Rong!

30:59.092 --> 31:00.452
Don't worry about me.

31:01.442 --> 31:02.802
What are you doing?

31:03.792 --> 31:09.222
♪ Life is like flowers,
blooming and fading with the seasons ♪

31:10.302 --> 31:15.492
♪ Wind leaves marks,
swaying in the breeze ♪

31:16.042 --> 31:19.192
♪ I don't wish for favors from the heavens ♪

31:19.212 --> 31:22.192
♪ To enjoy a blessed life ♪

31:22.402 --> 31:29.152
♪ I only wish to be unburdened ♪

31:29.642 --> 31:34.852
♪ Fate's been written; we're its slaves ♪

31:36.532 --> 31:37.892
Rong!

31:38.682 --> 31:40.042
Rong!

31:41.242 --> 31:42.662
- Ma'am...
- Rong!

31:42.682 --> 31:43.532
She...

31:43.532 --> 31:45.112
Rong!

31:45.132 --> 31:47.362
It's not my fault.

31:47.892 --> 31:49.452
Yuck!

31:50.052 --> 31:51.412
How I wish

31:51.892 --> 31:53.362
I could keep you.

31:53.612 --> 31:55.702
Let's get you changed into a pretty dress.

31:55.722 --> 31:57.972
Consider it my farewell gift.

31:58.572 --> 32:00.132
She'll have her first client tonight.

32:00.132 --> 32:01.572
Don't cause more trouble.

32:01.572 --> 32:03.662
We've lost one chick.

32:03.682 --> 32:05.042
Drag her inside.

32:05.892 --> 32:07.932
Tie her up and watch her closely.

32:07.932 --> 32:10.382
♪ How many regrets are left ♪

32:10.382 --> 32:13.972
♪ To be remedied ♪

32:13.992 --> 32:20.482
♪ A shared bond, a tragic ending ♪

32:25.922 --> 32:26.922
Magistrate Jia?

32:26.922 --> 32:28.242
They're in cahoots.

32:28.242 --> 32:29.082
That explains it.

32:29.092 --> 32:31.412
Here's a little something for you.

32:32.962 --> 32:33.842
Not bad.

32:33.852 --> 32:34.692
Let's dash.

32:34.712 --> 32:35.872
- Let's go.
- We can't!

32:35.892 --> 32:36.552
Uh...

32:36.572 --> 32:38.142
We don't know how many people they have.

32:38.142 --> 32:39.272
If we act rashly,

32:39.292 --> 32:41.732
Miss Si might get hurt.

32:42.402 --> 32:43.842
What's your plan?

32:45.372 --> 32:46.512
- Long Dan.
- Yes.

32:46.532 --> 32:48.032
Fetch Mr. Zhen quickly.

32:48.052 --> 32:48.892
Yes, sir.

32:48.902 --> 32:50.182
Be very careful.

32:50.202 --> 32:51.562
Take these.

32:57.052 --> 32:58.452
Stay here as lookouts.

32:58.652 --> 33:00.312
I'll get in and check.

33:00.332 --> 33:02.002
Be careful, Qi.

33:12.522 --> 33:13.442
Stay here.

33:13.442 --> 33:15.192
Don't move.

33:15.212 --> 33:17.362
I'll get something pretty for you to wear.

33:17.482 --> 33:18.842
Let's go.

33:23.002 --> 33:24.362
Jiang Si!

33:33.722 --> 33:36.042
I didn't see you when I got back.

33:36.092 --> 33:37.552
I was worried sick

33:37.572 --> 33:39.842
- about you!
- You found me.

33:40.762 --> 33:42.072
It's fine.

33:42.092 --> 33:43.452
Let's go.

33:44.092 --> 33:45.352
We can't leave yet.

33:45.372 --> 33:46.722
If that woman

33:46.722 --> 33:47.762
and her son find me gone,

33:47.762 --> 33:49.312
they'll destroy all the evidence.

33:49.332 --> 33:50.182
Then

33:50.202 --> 33:51.202
more women will be

33:51.202 --> 33:52.762
harmed by them.

33:53.722 --> 33:55.082
Alright.

33:55.532 --> 33:57.042
I'll stand guard outside.

34:01.652 --> 34:04.052
It's time to get changed.

34:05.652 --> 34:08.212
Look at you trying to escape.

34:08.492 --> 34:10.042
You got dirt on your face.

34:17.412 --> 34:19.322
You're so not a man.

34:19.722 --> 34:20.862
What a big baby

34:20.882 --> 34:22.852
and mama's boy.

34:22.872 --> 34:23.722
What did you say?

34:23.722 --> 34:25.362
Was I wrong?

34:25.492 --> 34:26.662
I have a guess, though.

34:26.682 --> 34:28.802
Maybe you're

34:28.802 --> 34:30.572
sweet and kind

34:31.132 --> 34:32.742
but forced to

34:32.762 --> 34:33.652
harm all those

34:33.652 --> 34:35.132
innocent women.

34:35.412 --> 34:37.262
You're dressed as a woman

34:37.282 --> 34:39.922
because you haven't found your love.

34:39.972 --> 34:42.392
Once the government tracks you down,

34:42.412 --> 34:43.722
you'll be doomed.

34:43.722 --> 34:44.822
What's your point?

34:44.842 --> 34:46.242
My reputation

34:46.242 --> 34:47.922
has been ruined.

34:48.202 --> 34:49.802
I have nowhere else to go.

34:50.162 --> 34:51.612
If I agree...

34:53.652 --> 34:55.262
to be with you,

34:55.282 --> 34:56.662
will you

34:56.682 --> 34:58.302
abandon your mother

34:58.322 --> 34:59.732
to leave with me now?

35:01.572 --> 35:02.932
Do you mean it?

35:02.972 --> 35:05.322
Do you think I have other choices?

35:05.882 --> 35:07.432
A defiled girl

35:07.452 --> 35:09.052
shall die.

35:21.092 --> 35:23.322
Fine. We have a deal.

35:23.572 --> 35:25.072
If you agree to be my love,

35:25.092 --> 35:26.952
we can leave today and go far away.

35:26.972 --> 35:28.692
We've made tons of money.

35:28.762 --> 35:30.122
But...

35:30.572 --> 35:32.222
my mother is too tough.

35:32.242 --> 35:33.932
I don't have the money yet.

35:33.932 --> 35:35.072
Do you know

35:35.092 --> 35:37.392
if she has anything so valuable

35:37.412 --> 35:39.112
that she'll risk her life

35:39.132 --> 35:40.732
to keep it safe?

35:41.012 --> 35:42.702
If you're able to find

35:42.722 --> 35:44.282
and obtain it,

35:44.322 --> 35:45.952
she'll give you

35:45.972 --> 35:46.972
whatever you want.

35:46.972 --> 35:48.332
I see.

35:52.932 --> 35:55.402
Wait for me, darling.

36:24.682 --> 36:26.132
Son!

36:26.802 --> 36:27.682
Where's she?

36:27.682 --> 36:29.132
She's gone!

36:30.722 --> 36:31.842
- Si!
- Miss!

36:31.842 --> 36:33.132
- Zhan!
- I thought

36:33.132 --> 36:34.132
I'd lose you forever!

36:34.132 --> 36:35.472
- Si!
- Jiang Si!

36:35.492 --> 36:37.032
- Si!
- Zhan!

36:37.052 --> 36:37.922
Are you alright?

36:37.932 --> 36:38.882
Did he hurt you?

36:38.882 --> 36:40.732
I'm good. Relax.

36:42.322 --> 36:43.822
Mr. Zhen,

36:43.842 --> 36:45.912
Lingwu County is right ahead.

36:45.932 --> 36:47.662
The road is bumpy.

36:47.682 --> 36:49.032
Are you alright?

36:49.052 --> 36:51.072
I'm fine, Long Dan.

36:51.092 --> 36:52.492
Go as fast as you can.

36:57.652 --> 36:59.402
- I'm fine.
- Miss Si,

36:59.722 --> 37:01.132
did you see a woman

37:01.722 --> 37:03.142
named Rong?

37:03.162 --> 37:04.762
She's my wife.

37:05.012 --> 37:06.392
Did you see her there?

37:06.412 --> 37:07.302
Mr. Yu,

37:07.322 --> 37:08.692
did you see Rong?

37:09.162 --> 37:10.532
Master Qin,

37:11.052 --> 37:12.412
Rong...

37:14.612 --> 37:16.362
Rong killed herself.

37:22.492 --> 37:24.212
She killed herself...

37:27.532 --> 37:29.162
No way. No.

37:29.162 --> 37:30.302
No.

37:30.322 --> 37:31.242
Rong!

37:31.252 --> 37:32.132
Master Qin...

37:32.132 --> 37:33.682
I'll slaughter those animals!

37:33.682 --> 37:35.782
Master Qin!

37:35.802 --> 37:36.862
Master Qin!

37:36.882 --> 37:38.242
Hold it for me.

37:38.882 --> 37:40.142
Were you cut?

37:40.162 --> 37:41.092
I'm good. I'll help him.

37:41.092 --> 37:42.412
Hold on!

37:45.932 --> 37:48.142
Master Qin! Master Qin!

37:48.162 --> 37:49.522
Master Qin,

37:49.882 --> 37:51.252
calm down.

37:51.612 --> 37:52.702
I'll kill them all

37:52.722 --> 37:53.572
for Rong's death!

37:53.572 --> 37:54.722
Master Qin, we aren't sure

37:54.722 --> 37:55.682
about the things inside.

37:55.682 --> 37:57.572
Breaking in like this will get us killed!

37:57.572 --> 37:59.252
Rong is dead.

37:59.322 --> 38:01.132
I'd rather die with her!

38:01.132 --> 38:03.282
If you died, who'd take revenge for her?

38:24.762 --> 38:25.612
Good liquor!

38:25.612 --> 38:27.402
One more cup. One more cup.

38:27.722 --> 38:28.572
I toast you, sir.

38:28.572 --> 38:29.762
I'll refill your cup.

38:29.762 --> 38:31.122
Cheers.

38:32.612 --> 38:36.032
It's you again.

38:36.052 --> 38:37.862
You failed in your duty.

38:37.882 --> 38:39.552
We don't trust you.

38:39.572 --> 38:40.492
That's why we're back

38:40.492 --> 38:41.632
for justice.

38:41.652 --> 38:42.662
Ridiculous.

38:42.682 --> 38:44.342
I don't have time

38:44.362 --> 38:45.662
for chitchat.

38:45.682 --> 38:47.362
You scum!

38:47.412 --> 38:49.032
Instead of keeping people safe,

38:49.052 --> 38:50.092
you're here indulging in

38:50.092 --> 38:51.012
drinks and lust.

38:51.012 --> 38:51.852
How dare you!

38:51.862 --> 38:53.182
Get out now,

38:53.202 --> 38:55.962
or I'll have all of you arrested.

38:57.162 --> 38:59.392
(Ling'an)
Commandant Yu Qi of Capital Security.

38:59.412 --> 39:02.282
- I'll get to the bottom of this case.
- Go, go, go!

39:06.012 --> 39:08.882
Commandant Yu, sir,

39:09.162 --> 39:10.282
forgive my ignorance.

39:10.282 --> 39:11.612
I didn't recognize you.

39:11.612 --> 39:13.742
Please don't take it to heart.

39:13.762 --> 39:15.222
What case is it

39:15.242 --> 39:16.652
that troubles you

39:16.652 --> 39:18.282
to come all the way here?

39:18.282 --> 39:20.162
You know that woman and her son

39:20.162 --> 39:21.862
who run the Shan'an Clinic, right?

39:21.882 --> 39:23.492
Her son in female attire has been

39:23.492 --> 39:25.592
assaulting and selling innocent women.

39:25.612 --> 39:28.052
Do you know nothing about that?

39:32.242 --> 39:33.162
Do you mean

39:33.162 --> 39:35.392
Shen Xin'er and her mother?

39:35.412 --> 39:37.862
They have a good reputation here

39:37.882 --> 39:40.512
for their excellent medical skills.

39:40.532 --> 39:42.682
Look at you calling black white.

39:42.682 --> 39:43.842
You're something else.

39:43.842 --> 39:44.882
You mistake an obvious man

39:44.882 --> 39:45.882
for a woman!

39:45.882 --> 39:47.652
It's all but a misunderstanding.

39:47.652 --> 39:48.992
Outside the hut in the woods,

39:49.012 --> 39:51.512
Mrs. Shen passed a bag of money

39:51.532 --> 39:53.052
to you, right?

39:53.092 --> 39:54.482
Mr. Jia.

39:58.202 --> 39:59.052
Mr. Zhen.

39:59.052 --> 40:02.182
"Fear not sternness but justice.

40:02.202 --> 40:04.692
Admire not ability but fairness."

40:04.802 --> 40:06.242
You disregard the law and justice

40:06.242 --> 40:07.202
for your selfish gains

40:07.202 --> 40:08.412
when handling cases!

40:08.412 --> 40:09.742
You sit up on high

40:09.762 --> 40:12.302
while I'm a lowly magistrate.

40:12.322 --> 40:14.512
You don't know certain things

40:14.532 --> 40:15.912
unless you see for yourself.

40:15.932 --> 40:17.282
Today, someone's daughter

40:17.282 --> 40:18.362
goes to that clinic.

40:18.362 --> 40:19.452
Tomorrow, someone's wife

40:19.452 --> 40:20.472
goes there.

40:20.492 --> 40:21.532
How will those women

40:21.532 --> 40:22.532
live on?

40:22.532 --> 40:24.142
Regarding Shen Xin'er's case,

40:24.162 --> 40:25.912
I've got the evidence.

40:25.932 --> 40:27.222
It's irrefutable.

40:27.242 --> 40:29.682
You're guilty of malpractice,
bending the law,

40:29.682 --> 40:30.882
and corruption.

40:30.882 --> 40:31.822
Guards,

40:31.842 --> 40:33.572
- take him away!
- Yes.

40:33.612 --> 40:34.862
Go! Move!

40:34.882 --> 40:36.242
Keep up! Keep us!

40:36.612 --> 40:38.482
- Go!
- What to do?

40:43.452 --> 40:45.392
Master Qin! Master Qin!

40:45.412 --> 40:46.702
I'll kill you!

40:46.722 --> 40:48.302
Calm down, Master Qin!

40:48.322 --> 40:49.322
I have to kill them

40:49.322 --> 40:50.322
for Rong's death!

40:50.322 --> 40:51.912
Don't do it, Master Qin!

40:51.932 --> 40:53.072
They deserve death,

40:53.092 --> 40:54.362
but if you kill them,

40:54.362 --> 40:55.322
you'll be guilty, too.

40:55.322 --> 40:56.532
You'll be ruined!

40:56.532 --> 40:57.572
Being killed by you

40:57.572 --> 40:58.862
is too easy for them.

40:58.882 --> 41:00.132
Do you know the sentence

41:00.132 --> 41:01.142
for their crimes?

41:01.162 --> 41:02.162
They'll be

41:02.162 --> 41:03.342
cut into pieces.

41:03.362 --> 41:04.532
Guards, take them away!

41:04.532 --> 41:06.012
Spare my son, please!

41:06.012 --> 41:08.132
- Go!
- I'm begging you!

41:16.762 --> 41:18.122
Master Qin,

41:18.322 --> 41:19.612
where are you going?

41:19.612 --> 41:21.132
Rong left me.

41:21.162 --> 41:22.882
I no longer have a home.

41:23.132 --> 41:24.492
I'd rather

41:24.652 --> 41:26.282
go to a temple to pray

41:26.322 --> 41:28.032
for the rest of my life.

41:28.052 --> 41:30.162
I'd like to say goodbye before leaving.

41:30.162 --> 41:31.392
Master Qin...

41:31.412 --> 41:33.012
I've made up my mind.

41:33.162 --> 41:35.142
Please let me go.

41:35.162 --> 41:36.532
Master Qin,

41:36.842 --> 41:38.442
I'll escort you.

41:38.652 --> 41:39.592
Si,

41:39.612 --> 41:41.312
we've been in Lingwu for too long.

41:41.332 --> 41:42.752
If we go back to Lingshui as planned

41:42.752 --> 41:43.752
for ancestor worship,

41:43.772 --> 41:45.802
I'll miss the Guard orientation.

41:46.162 --> 41:47.092
I've talked to Yu

41:47.092 --> 41:48.862
and Mr. Zhen.

41:48.882 --> 41:50.182
They'll escort you.

41:50.202 --> 41:51.592
That's a relief.

41:51.612 --> 41:53.052
Go back then, Zhan.

41:53.052 --> 41:54.732
Your work is more important.

41:54.762 --> 41:55.882
Once I get to Lingshui,

41:55.882 --> 41:57.472
I'll explain to Yi.

41:57.492 --> 41:59.402
Take care of yourself.

41:59.682 --> 42:01.042
I will.

42:01.572 --> 42:02.932
Let's go, Master Qin.

42:04.532 --> 42:07.132
Take care, Miss Si.

42:15.012 --> 42:16.372
Miss Si,

42:16.802 --> 42:18.222
it's chilly at night.

42:18.242 --> 42:19.432
Don't catch a cold.

42:19.452 --> 42:20.662
Zhen,

42:20.682 --> 42:22.552
thankfully, you came in time.

42:22.572 --> 42:24.222
Otherwise, Magistrate Jia

42:24.242 --> 42:25.162
would brush away

42:25.162 --> 42:26.262
that case for sure.

42:26.282 --> 42:28.432
What else is troubling you?

42:28.452 --> 42:30.112
I heard

42:30.132 --> 42:31.322
most of the women,

42:31.322 --> 42:32.962
who had been to that clinic,

42:33.682 --> 42:34.652
were forced to die

42:34.652 --> 42:36.112
by their husbands' families.

42:36.132 --> 42:37.692
I wonder

42:38.532 --> 42:40.362
if I made a mistake.

42:42.012 --> 42:43.372
No.

42:49.872 --> 42:54.232
(The End of Episode 16)

42:54.682 --> 42:56.412
♪ From place to place ♪

42:56.412 --> 43:01.352
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:01.722 --> 43:04.102
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:04.102 --> 43:08.332
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:09.042 --> 43:11.442
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:11.462 --> 43:15.122
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:15.142 --> 43:18.562
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:18.712 --> 43:24.232
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:25.052 --> 43:28.732
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:28.732 --> 43:32.812
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:33.052 --> 43:34.792
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.812 --> 43:39.512
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:39.512 --> 43:43.082
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:43.102 --> 43:47.332
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:47.352 --> 43:49.132
♪ Time glows ♪

43:49.132 --> 43:53.672
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:53.692 --> 43:58.492
♪ And stars ♪

44:02.722 --> 44:05.252
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:05.272 --> 44:08.892
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.912 --> 44:12.342
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:12.362 --> 44:16.982
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.982 --> 44:20.672
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:20.692 --> 44:24.782
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.892 --> 44:26.712
♪ Time glows ♪

44:26.712 --> 44:31.262
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:31.282 --> 44:34.982
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:35.002 --> 44:39.162
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:39.342 --> 44:41.102
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:41.102 --> 44:45.622
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:45.622 --> 44:49.262
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:49.282 --> 44:54.952
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:56.642 --> 44:58.572
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:58.572 --> 45:06.072
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
